SI ad-prod: Active Directory 2022 Prod
SI box-prod: Box Prod
SI sn-prod: SN Prod
SI exchange-prod: MS Exchange 2016 Prod
SI sap-prod: SAP Prod

TMSO ad-admin: Active Directory Administration
TMS identity: Identity Mgmt
TMSO windows-admin: Windows Administration
TMS compute: Compute/Hosting Services

BSO box: Box
BS file-sharing: File Sharing

CI(Application) webproxy: WebProxy@serverabc
CI(Application) adfs: ADFS@server123
CI(Application) ds1: DS1@server456
CI(Application) aad-connect: Azure AD-Connect@server789
# slide labels these "Infrastructure"
CI(Server) serverabc: Serverabc
CI(Server) server123: Server123
CI(Server) server456: Server456
CI(Server) server789: Server789

# not modelled: SLA and Support tags on the TMSO, "Dynamic CI groups can be added here" note,
